tar": "53b462de299ebbb4c68dff0f3b39ff8134fc34af"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty fun little game, lots of replayability in different hero builds and difficulties/scroll combinations, like a compact first-person PoE in some ways. Can be fun, and frustrating. Perhaps a bit unlike PoE, it really shines when playing with friends. Once you've more or less mastered the game, it still returns in my cycle of games occasionally just for the frenetic shoot-and-smash frenetic gameplay. Would definitely recommend trying it when it is on sale with a friend or three.", "timestamp_created": 1662591277, "timestamp_updated": 1662591277, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "121902426", "author": {"steamid": "76561197973567385", "personaname": "Blinkflux", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/moosefeet/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 16017, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10651, "last_played": 1705597479, "avatar": "aa0ca8a38f01afd5ae6f1b0d9364a255076c91d0"}, "language": "english", "review": "An addictive blend that will guarantee many hours of fun. There's a good amount of experimentation to be had and it's a solid shooter. When your build comes together and you fulfill a power fantasy of nothing standing in your way is gratifying.", "timestamp_created": 1662590724, "timestamp_updated": 1662590724, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "12190027